  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Eng 100 DEFINITIONS, ORGANIZATION AND PUBLIC INFORMATION\n\nREVISION NOTE:\n\nDocument #5397, effective 5-20-92, made extensive changes to the wording, format, structure and numbering of rules in Chapter Eng 100. Document #5397 supersedes all prior filings for the sections in this chapter. The prior filings for former Chapter Eng 100 include the following documents:\n\n#2364-a, eff 5-17-83\n\n#3031, eff 5-28-85, EXPIRED: 5-28-91",
